                            <additions>
                                <p>
                                    <locus from="1v" to="1v" scheme="folios"/>
                                    <note>In brown ink by a modern hand: <quote>Till K. Gymnasii Bibliothequet i Strengnäs af H. Hr. Kammarherren Baron A. Fleming år 1826.</quote> Added in lighter brown ink: <quote>No 6.</quote> To the left: <quote>1522</quote>. In pencil: <quote>21/7</quote>.
                                        In dark brown ink by an early modern hand: <quote>Fraternitas in Capella S Annae Ecclesiae S Nicolai episcopi</quote>. This hand has been idenfied as Zygmunt Gregorowicz of Radomsko, Krakow professor and (since 1645) a rector of St Nicolas Church. </note>
                                </p>
                            </additions>
                            <decoDesc>
                                <decoNote type="miniature">
                                    <p>Holy Kinship</p>
                                </decoNote>
                            </decoDesc>
