                                <p>
                                    <origPlace>
                                        <placeName ref="https://www.manuscripta.se/place/100066">Poland</placeName>
                                        <placeName ref="https://www.manuscripta.se/place/100276">Kraków</placeName>
                                    </origPlace>, <origDate when="1522">1522</origDate></p>
                            </origin>
                            <provenance>
                                <p>The charter belonged to the Brotherhood of the Poor (Fraternitas Pauperum) at St Nicholas Church in <placeName ref="https://www.manuscripta.se/place/100276">Krakow</placeName>. From there, it was probably looted by the Swedes during the Thirty Years War. </p>
                            </provenance>
                            <provenance>
                                <p>Baron <persName>Axel Herman Fleming af Liebelitz</persName>.</p>
                            </provenance>
                            <acquisition>
                                <p> Donated by <persName ref="https://www.manuscripta.se/person/102798">Axel Herman Fleming af Liebelitz</persName> to the library of <orgName ref="https://www.manuscripta.se/org/100197">Strängnäs gymnasium</orgName> (today <orgName ref="https://www.manuscripta.se/org/100055">Roggebiblioteket</orgName>) in <date when="1826"/>.</p>
